  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EPH 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ine neo baposa mu cifungo pa mulandu wakubombela Imfumu, ndemupapata ukuti muleenda ne myendele iyalinga no bwite Lesa amwitako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.3.12+COL.3.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kolo 3:12-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muleicefya lyonse, mube abamutembo, muletekelana imitima. Muletemwana mukushipikishanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulesakamana ukusunga icumfwano Mupashi amupeela mukwikala na banenu pamo mu mutende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwabafye umubili umo na Mupashi umo, nga filya fine kwabafye icakusubila cimo ico Lesa amwitako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwabafye Imfumu imo, icisumino cimo no lubatisho lumo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwabafye Lesa umo, kabili e Wishi wa bantu bonse. Wena alicila pali bonse, abomba muli bonse, aba na muli bonse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifwe bonse umo umo, ukulingana nomo Kristu alefwaila ukupeela, twalipokelelako icikuuku cakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.68.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amalu 68:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efyo casoswa mu Malembo Yamushilo ukuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi ndemweba no kumukonkomesha pa cinso ca Mfumu ukuti, mwilaenda ne myendele yabuwelewele nga bantu abashaishiba Lesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amano yabo yalikutwa. Balitaluka na ku mweo Lesa apeela. Pantu tabaishiba nelyo cimo, kabili bantu baumalala imitima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tabomfwa nsoni nakalya. Baiposa abene kuli bucilende, kabili babikapofye no kulacita ifibi ifya misango yonse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba imwe tefyo mwasambilile pali Kristu iyoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga cacine cine mwalyumfwa pali Kristu, elyo kabili mwalifundwa ne fyacishinka pali Kristu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi fuuleni imisango yenu iyakale. Muleke imikalile ya bumuntu bwenu ubwakale ubwa lunkumbwa ululebonaula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imitima yenu na mano yenu fisanguke ifipya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muli nokufwala bumuntu bupya, ubwabumbwa mu cata cakwa Lesa, pakuti ubumi bwenu bulemoneka icine cine ubwamushilo kabinge ubwakaele pa cinso cakwa Lesa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi, lekeni ubufi! Cila umo alelanda ifyacishinka ku munankwe, pantu ifwe bonse tuli filundwa fya mubili umo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.4.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amalu 4:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga cakuti mwafulwa, mwilaleka ukufulwa kwenu kumutwale kukubifya. Mwileka akasuba kawe mwikelefye mukufulwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwilaleka Ciwa ashukile akashita kakumutwala mu ntunko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwaleiba aleke ukulaiba. Atampe nomba ukubomba, pakuti aleisunga mukuibombela umwine, akwate ne fyakukumbusukako abalanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwilabomfya mashiwi yabi, lelo mulebomfyafye amashiwi yakubafwa, ayakubakosha, ayalingile pali iyo nshita, epakuti yaletele ipaalo ku baleumfwako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwilalenga Mupashi Wamushilo wakwa Lesa ukuba no bulanda. Pantu Mupashi uo mwakwata e cishibilo mwashininkishishako ukuti muli bantu bakwa Lesa, abo akalubula pali bulya Bushiku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:30",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Pali bulya Bushiku:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Emukutila Ubushiku bwa Mfumu. Ubushiku Imfumu ikaputula imilandu ya bomi na bafwa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwilaba abasashila ku banenu, muleke icipyu no bukali. Mwilaotokela muntu nelyo umo nangu ukumubepesha. Mwilapata muntu nelyo umo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.3.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kolo 3:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo muleba ne cilela, kabili abamutembo ku banenu. Mulebelela abanenu uluse, nga filya Lesa amubelela uluse pa mulandu wakwa Kristu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
